        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiinajeega simng'awsa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Yoshuwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli gideaba, ‘Ghwaloat mujiinajeega jea eemng'awsa, gawuurji gidaghayi eabalooldaneegwa aba naweeda Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba siida bwar siida, nea ghabwar siida wassean nea mabaysiina ak gabiisa ea mwanala abeeda gaygamng'awsa hoowa, ak gayghoah heechea amng'awsiina, gajamng'awa aba badaydeaba siidida waliida foojeandean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygamng'awsa jeemba mujiineanagi aba jeedeaba mujiinajeesu; ak gayghamiinaada aba ghuuta dooshta mujiini, ak gaygwarukusa ng'asheagaaschi gweargwa mujiini; ak gajeayaat niny jeeda mujiini, ak geataw niny heechea goobiida ak goobiida bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda inyas gweadu geeshtaanyi siida wala mureandoodean abeeda ea majeayiin siidida bwar siidean geatindaanyi; aba gideaba ghabwar giischeewoocheandaanyi nea mabaysiina, ak gabean ea mii weajoocheandaanyi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygoobiida jeedeaba mujiineedida ea gwayi bwak ak ghamiinaada aba madeeda fuga bwat geat aba girgweaksiinda, ea ghwahita damanda miyeadaanyi ninyeeda was ashoohoocheanda haw aba damandida: hean gaygabiikta gicha siidida bwar siidean jeeda mujiineadaanyi ea gheanyi, ea ghwahita mujiineeda ghayi mang'awsa.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gealoat Gedesheeda mida jeeda Galilaya bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea fuga Naftali, ea Shekemu mida jeeda ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea fuga Efraimu, ea Giriat-arba (nea Hebroni) mida jeeda ng'eanyiida heayeeniga ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea giigheawda Yordani bea gayeewda Yeriko ak gealoat Beseri mida jeeda dareapcheeda bea ng'eanyiida awiida ghang'eada eemeeda Rubeni, Ramoti mida Gileyadi ak ghang'eada eemeeda Gadi, ea Golani mida Bashani bea eemeeda Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh mujiinajeega siloat gil aba fuga Israeli sean, ea rabasta mida bugusta nyaawa, ea siida wassean bwar siida nea mabaysiina gaygafachsa hoowa, aba gideaba adaghabwar siida jea ghawalda mureandooda foojeanda, ak gaygwayi bwak ea ghamiinaada aba madeeda fuga bwat geat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
